    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological adventure through a dreamy landscape. Face unanswerable questions to reach the ultimate enigmas: Who are you? Who am I?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/5ad4c8f596f3c71b68a610a0703636a1.webp?t=1749177020\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a mysterious creature donning a flower wreath, and it only refers to itself as <i>I</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I</i> will ask you questions, and the conversation will progress based on your answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What would you do if you could meet your past self?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you could buy other people's experiences with money, would you?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the questions will be things that you may have asked yourself already. Some may lead you to unexplored parts of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no right answer. What matters is what you believe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/7172a3b0148d5bbd50c15e33b45981d8.poster.avif?t=1749177020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/7172a3b0148d5bbd50c15e33b45981d8.webm?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/7172a3b0148d5bbd50c15e33b45981d8.mp4?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After answering a question, you will be shown everyone else's answers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many chose as you did? And why did the others choose differently?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into your own mind as you try to glance at someone else's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/f6ec6f5d5e9ba28812a9699a4a59cb81.poster.avif?t=1749177020\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/f6ec6f5d5e9ba28812a9699a4a59cb81.webm?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/f6ec6f5d5e9ba28812a9699a4a59cb81.mp4?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/a244f5027bfcdade0a8f0b852fac3f08.webp?t=1749177020\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every door is connected to an answer. Go through the one you chose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/e6e5291e56afb51a128b0f4b8a38afcf.poster.avif?t=1749177020\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/e6e5291e56afb51a128b0f4b8a38afcf.webm?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/e6e5291e56afb51a128b0f4b8a38afcf.mp4?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your choices will change the room that you are in. Take a stroll through this visual representation of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe, after you've gone through enough doors, you will realize this world's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/8d7da7fca8b8bf5d6d528477301dc798.poster.avif?t=1749177020\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/8d7da7fca8b8bf5d6d528477301dc798.webm?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/8d7da7fca8b8bf5d6d528477301dc798.mp4?t=1749177020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/a0cf1e597622ba6bfd93ccb2675b5b2b.webp?t=1749177020\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many questions await you. Some will be about common food items, while some will be about matters of life and death. None of them, however, have clear-cut answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You might wonder: why am I being asked these things in the first place?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you realize the reason between all of those questions, you may choose to face the reality hidden behind that simple donut hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But do so at your own discretion. If you go too deep, there's no guarantee you'll be able to come back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/7000485b0ec52ae44484d4a91dcd7f7d.webp?t=1749177020\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/17b7ad111df2b907b369ba185b64693e.webp?t=1749177020\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is <i>I</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/f877b95c8b6fd4b1652d7608bf9bf6b1.avif?t=1749177020\" width=120 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creature that loves talking, but remains vanishing and mysterious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I</i> would like to ask you some questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is <i>you</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/1ff3fe63105c4ce5f23ed2608b8e5883.avif?t=1749177020\" width=120 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices <i>you</i> will take belong to  <i>you</i>, as they come from your own memories and experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/be081a65f9a9e133c1239ac94c29c956.avif?t=1749177020\" data-has-big width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over a hundred new questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A new, expanded plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex interactions between your answers and the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improved graphics and new stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Backlog functions to see past questions and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- English and Chinese (simplified and traditional) support.</p>",
